  "rebindReason": {
    "applicationOwnershipDrift": "Production integration materialized in EditorViewportRuntime, EditorController, EditorRendererAdapter, SceneEditorUi, and SceneEditor core paths that were absent from the frozen P6-90 list.",
    "integerTargetHardDependency": "The frozen P6-10 picking shader returns uint, but the current RHI has no integer color format or Vulkan/D3D12 mappings.",
    "legacyAuthorityConflict": "EditorSelectionState still owns an independent value, revision, and event while P6-00 freezes SceneSelection as the sole production authority.",
    "visibleHighlightGap": "No production shader currently composites a revision- and fence-bound Node-subtree or exact-Primitive highlight."
  },
  "revisionSha256": "8c42ded05a7782b2b4a35772c9ef9c03ae6edb51dc030a069799eaceaa4a0b97",
  "roleConstraints": [
    "SceneSelection is the sole production selection value, revision, and event authority; the legacy EditorSelectionState is a non-owning compatibility facade and may retain only a derived legacy view.",
    "Primitive legacy transport preserves instanceOrdinal losslessly; no raw node, draw, dense, registry, or framebuffer index becomes selection identity.",
    "Projection and upload planning carry canonical scene, node, primitive, instance ordinal, and node topology into one immutable occurrence snapshot sealed with renderer publication.",
    "GPUDrivenRenderer owns the occurrence/token sidecar; GPUSceneRegistry handles and dense indices remain private and its readOnlyExpected paths normally retain their preimage hashes.",
    "RendererFacade composes exactly one ScenePicking producer/backend and provides full-fence enqueue, poll, cancel, renderer-busy, and revision-bound highlight handoff.",
    "Every accepted pick produces exactly one terminal result; retained occurrence and GPU/readback generations outlive exact ticket and SubmissionToken retirement.",
    "Projection, viewport, device, document, and scene replacement cancel affected picks before releasing resources; normal enqueue, poll, cancel, and highlight paths never wait for device idle.",
    "The production CPU mesh-AABB picker, single-slot pending pick, stale-result clear, rendererBusy=false hardcode, and runtime release-wins O06 branch are removed.",
    "Runtime consumes the frozen EditorViewportMetrics and the completed P6-20 frame-close arbitration exactly; both same-batch Escape/release orders are no-history while prior-frame ordinary release commits once.",
    "Double-hit camera focus keeps eye, centers at origin plus direction times positive distance, sets navigation speed to that distance, and increments one view revision; Browser reveal and scroll never switch tabs.",
    "The frozen MaterialClipboardCodec and an upstream-ImGui OS clipboard adapter are the sole production clipboard grammar and transport.",
    "TextureFormat::r32Uint is appended without renumbering existing values and maps exactly to VK_FORMAT_R32_UINT and DXGI_FORMAT_R32_UINT.",
    "Highlight resolves current snapshot-local tokens for Node visible subtree or exact Primitive occurrence and rejects mismatched EditorSceneFence or selection revision without an old-frame flash.",
    "P7 overlay, Gizmo rendering, FrameScheduler, PassExecutor, later-phase UI/lifecycle work, locked parity documents, and the frozen legacy pointer remain outside this task."
  ],
